# Downloaded asset packs: never commit third-party art here. Only the specific
# files the game uses are tracked, under src/assets/ (see the README beside them).
#
# This list is a convenience, not the safety net — a pack folder with a new name
# sails straight past it, which is how NightBorne ended up committed. The actual
# guard is tests/unit/tracked-files.test.ts, which fails the build if anything
# outside the expected directories is tracked. Add new packs here anyway, so
# `git status` stays quiet.
Characters PackV2/
TileSet wasteland/
TileSet Wasteland/
NightBorne/
